# Markdown representations of every docs page, emitted by
# scripts/emit-markdown.mjs on predev/prebuild. Generated from content/ (a
# symlink to ../docs), so committing them would duplicate the docs in the repo
# and let the copy drift from its source. One prefix means one ignore rule that
# cannot rot as docs sections are added.
public/_md/
